#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:87
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"valgrind\"/> (to run the tests), <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/> "
"(to build the GUI event viewer), <xref linkend=\"libunwind\"/> (required for"
" tests), <xref linkend=\"libwacom\"/>, <xref linkend=\"sphinx\"/> (required "
"to build documentation), and <xref linkend=\"pyparsing\"/> (for one non-root"
" test)"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"valgrind\"/> (para executar os testes), <xref "
"linkend=\"gtk3\"/> (para construir o visualizador de eventos da GUI), <xref "
"linkend=\"libunwind\"/> (exigido para testes), <xref linkend=\"libwacom\"/>,"
" <xref linkend=\"sphinx\"/> (exigido para construir documentação) e <xref "
"linkend=\"pyparsing\"/> (para um teste não root)"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid "Kernel Configuration for Running the Libinput Test Suite"
msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo para Executar a Suíte de Teste do Libinput"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Although libinput works with the same kernel configuration used by <xref "
"linkend=\"libevdev\"/>, its extensive test suite requires the presence of "
"<filename>/dev/uinput</filename> (as well as both <xref "
"linkend=\"valgrind\"/> and <xref linkend=\"libunwind\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Embora libinput funcione com a mesma configuração de núcleo usada por <xref "
"linkend=\"libevdev\"/>, a extenso suíte de teste exige a presença de "
"<filename>/dev/uinput</filename> (assim como ambos <xref "
"linkend=\"valgrind\"/> e <xref linkend=\"libunwind\"/>)."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:108
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you wish to run the full tests, enable the following option in the kernel"
" configuration and recompile the kernel if necessary:"
msgstr ""
"Se você desejar executar os testes completos, habilite a seguinte opção na "
"configuração do núcleo e recompile o núcleo se necessário:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you build this as a module, it needs to be inserted before the test suite"
" runs."
msgstr ""
"Se você construir isso como um módulo, ele precisará ser inserido antes que "
"a suíte de teste execute."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:123
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"On an Xorg system you will also need to prevent the events generated during "
"the test suite from interfering with your desktop.  Copy the file "
"<filename>test/50-litest.conf</filename> into <filename "
"class=\"directory\">${XORG_PREFIX}/share/X11/xorg.conf.d</filename> and "
"restart X. For further information see <ulink "
"url=\"https://wayland.freedesktop.org/libinput/doc/&libinput-version;/test-"
"suite.html\">libinput test suite</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Em um sistema Xorg você também precisará evitar que os eventos gerados "
"durante a suíte de teste interfiram em tua área de trabalho. Copie o arquivo"
" <filename>test/50-litest.conf</filename> para <filename "
"class=\"directory\">${XORG_PREFIX}/share/X11/xorg.conf.d</filename> e "
"reinicie o X. Para mais informações, veja-se <ulink "
"url=\"https://wayland.freedesktop.org/libinput/doc/&libinput-version;/test-"
"suite.html\">suíte de teste do libinput</ulink>."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Libinput"
msgstr "Instalação do Libinput"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libinput</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>libinput</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:144
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=$XORG_PREFIX    \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"            -Ddebug-gui=false        \\\n"
"            -Dtests=false            \\\n"
"            -Dlibwacom=false         \\\n"
"            -Dudev-dir=/usr/lib/udev \\\n"
"            ..                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=$XORG_PREFIX    \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"            -Ddebug-gui=false        \\\n"
"            -Dtests=false            \\\n"
"            -Dlibwacom=false         \\\n"
"            -Dudev-dir=/usr/lib/udev \\\n"
"            ..                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:158
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to run the full tests, remove -Dtests from the "
"<command>meson</command> command above. Please read \"kernel configuration "
"for running the libinput test suite\" (above)."
msgstr ""
"Se você quiser executar os testes completos, remova -Dtests do comando "
"<command>meson</command> acima. Por favor, leia \"configuração do núcleo "
"para executar a suíte de teste do libinput\" (acima)."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have enabled the full tests, you can run the main tests <emphasis>as "
"the root user</emphasis> by executing: <command>ninja test</command>. A very"
" large number of tests will be run. One test fails on wayland."
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver habilitado os testes completos, você pode executar os testes "
"principais <emphasis>como o(a) usuário(a) root</emphasis> executando: "
"<command>ninja test</command>. Um número muito grande de testes será "
"executado. Um teste falha no Wayland."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:175
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:178
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have passed <option>-Ddocumentation=true</option> to "
"<command>meson</command>, you can install the generated documentation by "
"running the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver passado <option>-Ddocumentation=true</option> para "
"<command>meson</command>, você pode instalar a documentação gerada "
"executando os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#.  seems the api doc is not generated because the directory is not a git
#.      repository...
#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:187
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755      /usr/share/doc/libinput-&libinput-version;/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -rv Documentation/* /usr/share/doc/libinput-&libinput-version;/html</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755      /usr/share/doc/libinput-&libinput-version;/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -rv Documentation/* /usr/share/doc/libinput-&libinput-version;/html</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:193
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:199
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Ddebug-gui=false</parameter>: This switch disables creation of a"
" visual debug helper for libinput. Remove if you want it, and you have <xref"
" linkend=\"gtk3\"/> installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Ddebug-gui=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a criação de"
" um auxiliar visual de depuração para libinput. Remova se o quiser e você "
"tiver o <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/> instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:205
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dtests=false</parameter>: This switch disables compilation of "
"the main tests.  Even with the tests defined as false, you can still run the"
" first four minor tests, as a regular user, but one will be skipped if <xref"
" linkend=\"pyparsing\"/> is not installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dtests=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a compilação dos"
" testes principais. Mesmo com os testes definidos como false, você ainda "
"consegue executar os primeiros quatro testes secundários, como um(a) "
"usuário(a) normal, mas um será ignorado se o <xref linkend=\"pyparsing\"/> "
"não estiver instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:212
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dlibwacom=false</parameter>: Remove this option if you have "
"<xref linkend=\"libwacom\"/> installed, or if you are installing GNOME."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dlibwacom=false</parameter>: Remova essa opção se você tiver "
"<xref linkend=\"libwacom\"/> instalado ou se estiver instalando o GNOME."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:218
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dudev-dir=/usr/lib/udev</parameter>: In case that the value of "
"<envar>XORG_PREFIX</envar> is not set to <filename "
"class='directory'>/usr</filename>, this option prevents the package from "
"installing Udev rules and helpers into <filename "
"class='directory'>$XORG_PREFIX/lib/udev</filename> which is not searched by "
"Udev daemon.  This option is not needed for systems with "
"<envar>XORG_PREFIX</envar> set to <filename "
"class='directory'>/usr</filename>, but does no harm."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dudev-dir=/usr/lib/udev</parameter>: Caso o valor de "
"<envar>XORG_PREFIX</envar> não esteja configurado como <filename "
"class='directory'>/usr</filename>, essa opção evita que o pacote instale "
"regras e auxiliares do Udev em <filename "
"class='directory'>$XORG_PREFIX/lib/udev</filename>, que não é pesquisado "
"pelo processo de segundo plano do Udev. Essa opção não é necessária para "
"sistemas com <envar>XORG_PREFIX</envar> configurado como <filename "
"class='directory'>/usr</filename>, mas não causa danos."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:229
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Ddocumentation=true</option>: This switch enables generation of the"
" documentation. Add it if you want to generate the documentation. You must "
"have <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> and <xref linkend=\"graphviz\"/> installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Ddocumentation=true</option>: Essa chave habilita a geração da "
"documentação. Adicione-a se quiser gerar a documentação. Você precisa ter "
"<xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> e <xref linkend=\"graphviz\"/> instalados."

